*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0025
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 226
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0025.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY INT0025C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM SET-SAVINGS-RATE
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SET-SAVINGS-RATE.
    *> TOP SAVINGS TIER
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'S'
       AND LEDGER-BAL >= 50000
        MOVE 0.0450 TO INT-RATE
    *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER
    ELSE IF ACCT-TYP = 'S'
       AND LEDGER-BAL >= 20000
        MOVE 0.0350 TO INT-RATE
    *> BASE SAVINGS RATE
    ELSE IF ACCT-TYP = 'S'
        MOVE 0.0275 TO INT-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0050 TO INT-RATE
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
